      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know there are hotlines and stuff but it doesnt change the reality. i wake up and i already feel exhausted. it's just this constant loop of chores, needs, and being exhausted. it feels like i've lost my entire self to this. i don't even recognize the person i used to be before everything became so heavy. i just want to stop feeling like this.",
